{"schemaVersion":1,"eventId":"b5f5b17b-d182-4742-a29a-8ba0bd30ca63","timestamp":"2026-10-18T16:33:20.466Z","type":"review_recorded","taskId":"msg-5e6251b0-deba-4939-9878-296c9a4d9bfe","attemptId":"attempt-de144460-d3f2-4c0f-b857-ddb91c4a8bc0","runId":"run-7ed71688-5220-4a6e-b6ea-51754f656831","reportSha256":"c904de6d5991dc8ec2535e88667fedf93c642476196564d42c71977b0ce96b6e","parsed":true,"coverageClaimed":["chapter:chapter-002.md","chapter:chapter-001.md","character:cen","character:he","character:lin","character:lu","character:su","character:ye","world:lore","world:places","outline:master","style:memory"],"coverageObserved":["chapter:chapter-002.md","chapter:chapter-001.md","outline:master","style:memory","character:cen","character:he","character:lin","character:lu","character:su","character:ye","world:places","world:lore"],"coverageVerified":true,"evidenceVerified":false,"issues":[{"issueId":"时间:chapter:chapter-002.md:启航时刻","category":"时间","severity":"suspicion","requestedSeverity":"suspicion","status":"open","contradiction":"20:18时说“五分钟后出港”，按文本推算约为20:23；结尾却写成20:20启航。时间线工具未能评估，尚不能确认为硬冲突。","evidence":[{"resourceRef":"chapter:chapter-002.md","hash":"d7d7002abe9bfd0bc0b36c386bf70700ee0e7b29dcfc2bd9c73737f2f5304f70","location":"L42-L43","quote":"20:18。林岚把潮表收回，指腹按着边角，不让雨水洇开墨线。她没有告诉任何人怀表慢了七分钟。此刻能确定的只是潮水正在落，航道尚可走；过了二十点半，拖船和抢近路都更危险。\n\n“我重系缆，验船底。”叶澄说，“五分钟后出港，走正规水路。听见异响再停，不抄浅滩。","currentHash":"d7d7002abe9bfd0bc0b36c386bf70700ee0e7b29dcfc2bd9c73737f2f5304f70","sourceCurrent":true,"quoteLocated":false,"quoteOffset":-1,"observed":false,"verified":false},{"resourceRef":"chapter:chapter-002.md","hash":"d7d7002abe9bfd0bc0b36c386bf70700ee0e7b29dcfc2bd9c73737f2f5304f70","location":"L58","quote":"没人回答他。林岚看着苏砚把双印通行证递给叶澄，叶澄转身去检查缆扣。决定已经落下：二十点二十启航，按四十分钟的正规水路走。药箱仍封着，账页仍不在众人眼前。雨声里，林岚将那页未拿出的抄本压回袖内。","currentHash":"d7d7002abe9bfd0bc0b36c386bf70700ee0e7b29dcfc2bd9c73737f2f5304f70","sourceCurrent":true,"quoteLocated":false,"quoteOffset":-1,"observed":false,"verified":false}],"evidenceComplete":true,"verified":false}]}
