{"schemaVersion":1,"eventId":"32684674-9b1e-4bd5-9d13-52abe3665d42","timestamp":"2026-10-18T16:45:25.389Z","type":"review_recorded","taskId":"msg-ace5d776-b3bb-46a1-811a-8c78cb34609c","attemptId":"attempt-dd3df853-83a8-4504-8dfb-009d0f3e71f0","runId":"run-846431ad-35b1-4e8f-bee3-77222548753c","reportSha256":"87d5943c1c979cb070b69a874d6aa9e106834db97b1c4e00de3da662e5531030","parsed":true,"coverageClaimed":["chapter:chapter-003.md","chapter:chapter-002.md","world:lore","character:he","character:lin","character:lu","character:su","character:ye","character:cen","character-memory:he","character-memory:lin","character-memory:lu","character-memory:su","character-memory:ye","character-memory:cen"],"coverageObserved":["chapter:chapter-003.md","character:he","character:lin","character:lu","character:su","character:ye","character:cen","character-memory:he","character-memory:lin","character-memory:lu","character-memory:su","character-memory:cen","world:lore","character-memory:ye","chapter:chapter-002.md"],"coverageVerified":false,"evidenceVerified":true,"issues":[{"issueId":"information-boundary:chapter-003.md:lin_seven_minutes","category":"信息边界","severity":"hard","requestedSeverity":"hard","status":"open","contradiction":"第三章林岚当众说出潮钟慢七分钟；第二章记载她没有告诉任何人。该揭露使在场人物获知此前未公开的信息。","evidence":[{"resourceRef":"chapter:chapter-003.md","hash":"2c766553d5dbe194734746f888f39635babf190b83eac2c244b1dde23bd9421d","location":"L31","quote":"林岚收起潮表：“钟楼那声报时不准。潮水没有因为它慢七分钟就停下。”她说得像是在提醒所有人，也像只在对自己说。没人追问那七分钟从哪里来。何芷记住了这个空白，却没有得到答案。","currentHash":"2c766553d5dbe194734746f888f39635babf190b83eac2c244b1dde23bd9421d","sourceCurrent":true,"quoteLocated":true,"quoteOffset":2303,"observed":true,"verified":true},{"resourceRef":"chapter:chapter-002.md","hash":"b4929a782ef416eba356589876f55be54d3c1acbdc7c9ee31f6f8c0867c58c70","location":"L59","quote":"20:10。林岚把潮表收回，指腹按着邊角，不让雨水洇开墨线。她没有告诉任何人潮钟慢了七分钟。此刻能确定的只是潮水正在落，航道尚可走；过了二十点半，拖船和抢近路都更危险。","currentHash":"b4929a782ef416eba356589876f55be54d3c1acbdc7c9ee31f6f8c0867c58c70","sourceCurrent":true,"quoteLocated":true,"quoteOffset":3834,"observed":true,"verified":true},{"resourceRef":"character:lin","hash":"1323037282f1622b210209de7f477966cbdf1d671912e44b011c38c62848bd18","location":"L9-L10","quote":"\"已知信息\": \"只知道潮钟慢了七分钟；不知道药箱暗格和密道口令\",\n    \"隐瞒事实\": \"保留一页抄本，未告诉任何人\"","currentHash":"1323037282f1622b210209de7f477966cbdf1d671912e44b011c38c62848bd18","sourceCurrent":true,"quoteLocated":true,"quoteOffset":221,"observed":true,"verified":true}],"evidenceComplete":true,"verified":true},{"issueId":"timeline:chapter-003.md:stop_and_arrival","category":"时间连续性","severity":"hard","requestedSeverity":"hard","status":"open","contradiction":"正文写20:20离港，路上停船检查几分钟，又在21:00抵达；设定规定该水路航程四十分钟且正规航道不得缩短。若停船时间计入完整航程，抵达时刻与途中停顿不相容。时间工具只核验20:20至21:00恰为四十分钟，未将停船另加计。","evidence":[{"resourceRef":"chapter:chapter-003.md","hash":"2c766553d5dbe194734746f888f39635babf190b83eac2c244b1dde23bd9421d","location":"L3","quote":"20:20，船离开旧渡口时，何芷仍把手扣在药箱提环上。她没有回头看冰柜。离柜计时从她说“走”时开始，苏砚在药单副页写下时刻，笔尖停得比她预想的久。","currentHash":"2c766553d5dbe194734746f888f39635babf190b83eac2c244b1dde23bd9421d","sourceCurrent":true,"quoteLocated":true,"quoteOffset":29,"observed":true,"verified":true},{"resourceRef":"chapter:chapter-003.md","hash":"2c766553d5dbe194734746f888f39635babf190b83eac2c244b1dde23bd9421d","location":"L29","quote":"这一停不过几分钟，苏砚仍在记录上写明停船、检查和重启时刻。何芷看着墨迹，药物离柜的时间一分不少地往前走。她忽然明白，苏砚并非不信她；他是不肯让任何人的保证代替记录。这样的谨慎救得了药，也会把她的隐瞒照得更清楚。","currentHash":"2c766553d5dbe194734746f888f39635babf190b83eac2c244b1dde23bd9421d","sourceCurrent":true,"quoteLocated":true,"quoteOffset":1986,"observed":true,"verified":true},{"resourceRef":"chapter:chapter-003.md","hash":"2c766553d5dbe194734746f888f39635babf190b83eac2c244b1dde23bd9421d","location":"L57","quote":"21:00，船抵灯塔诊所外的短栈桥。苏砚当面复核双印和离柜时刻，叶澄系牢船缆，陆行舟把绳段交给队长封存。何芷把药箱交给值夜医师点数，铅封完好，药品齐全。她没有打开暗格。岑寂在交接簿上写下“账页未见”，然后将公文收回。","currentHash":"2c766553d5dbe194734746f888f39635babf190b83eac2c244b1dde23bd9421d","sourceCurrent":true,"quoteLocated":true,"quoteOffset":4308,"observed":true,"verified":true},{"resourceRef":"world:lore","hash":"1d840b6aad84b6728ae68fa26509f29591a266edf805e35d7ead815cc8bd031c","location":"L4-L6","quote":"旧渡口到灯塔水路四十分钟，步行绕北堤九十分钟；钟楼到渡口步行十五分钟。不存在瞬移、飞行、瞬间传信。\n封桥时间为21:00，封桥只关闭东桥，不关闭水路；渡船仍须执照和通行证。\n低潮始于20:30，碎石滩不可拖曳重船；正规航道可航行但不得缩短四十分钟。","currentHash":"1d840b6aad84b6728ae68fa26509f29591a266edf805e35d7ead815cc8bd031c","sourceCurrent":true,"quoteLocated":true,"quoteOffset":233,"observed":true,"verified":true}],"evidenceComplete":true,"verified":true}]}
