{"schemaVersion":1,"eventId":"64d2675a-bbf0-4bc2-8be6-31b988cd15c4","timestamp":"2026-10-18T16:48:53.625Z","type":"review_recorded","taskId":"msg-ace5d776-b3bb-46a1-811a-8c78cb34609c","attemptId":"attempt-19a07c63-9738-415e-a585-a6f69336feea","runId":"run-82972f3b-1f46-4205-bc67-ab4ca14d4ecd","reportSha256":"0b8198b8647db09f1f194e8372562339d288c876b2da8cb24c2243cd17a7f2cd","parsed":true,"coverageClaimed":["chapter:chapter-003.md","character-memory:cen","character-memory:he","character-memory:lin","character-memory:lu","character-memory:su","character-memory:ye","world:lore"],"coverageObserved":["chapter:chapter-003.md","character:cen","character:lin","character:he","character:lu","character:su","character:ye","character-memory:cen","character-memory:he","character-memory:lu","character-memory:su","character-memory:ye","character-memory:lin","world:lore","chapter:chapter-002.md"],"coverageVerified":true,"evidenceVerified":true,"issues":[{"issueId":"信息边界:chapter:chapter-003.md:lin_seven_minutes","category":"信息边界","severity":"hard","requestedSeverity":"hard","status":"closed","contradiction":"此前第三章让林岚当众说出“慢七分钟”，与第二章她没有告诉任何人的状态冲突。修订后她只说钟楼报时不准，未公开误差数字；本章未让其他人物据此知晓七分钟。","evidence":[{"resourceRef":"chapter:chapter-003.md","hash":"8d6a925d8a2d3f1ec3a030330e297ed8b3b7ac3a9876c83f88653806b0e9bf1b","location":"L31","quote":"林岚收起潮表，只说：“钟楼那声报时不准。”她没有解释缘由，也没有再说下去。没人追问。何芷看见她把怀表往袖口里压深了一点，记住这个沉默，却没有得到答案。","currentHash":"8d6a925d8a2d3f1ec3a030330e297ed8b3b7ac3a9876c83f88653806b0e9bf1b","sourceCurrent":true,"quoteLocated":true,"quoteOffset":2330,"observed":true,"verified":true},{"resourceRef":"chapter:chapter-002.md","hash":"b4929a782ef416eba356589876f55be54d3c1acbdc7c9ee31f6f8c0867c58c70","location":"L59","quote":"20:10。林岚把潮表收回，指腹按着邊角，不让雨水洇开墨线。她没有告诉任何人潮钟慢了七分钟。此刻能确定的只是潮水正在落，航道尚可走；过了二十点半，拖船和抢近路都更危险。","currentHash":"b4929a782ef416eba356589876f55be54d3c1acbdc7c9ee31f6f8c0867c58c70","sourceCurrent":true,"quoteLocated":true,"quoteOffset":3834,"observed":true,"verified":true}],"evidenceComplete":true,"verified":true},{"issueId":"时间连续性:chapter:chapter-003.md:stop_and_arrival","category":"时间连续性","severity":"hard","requestedSeverity":"hard","status":"closed","contradiction":"此前章节未明确停船时长，却写20:20出发、21:00抵达。本次改为停船三分钟，21:03抵达，合计43分钟；时间工具按旧渡口至灯塔水路最低40分钟核验为可行。","evidence":[{"resourceRef":"chapter:chapter-003.md","hash":"8d6a925d8a2d3f1ec3a030330e297ed8b3b7ac3a9876c83f88653806b0e9bf1b","location":"L29","quote":"这一停三分钟。苏砚把停船、检查和重启的时刻逐项记下，三分钟没有从航程里消失。何芷看着墨迹，药物离柜的时间一分不少地往前走。她忽然明白，苏砚并非不信她；他是不肯让任何人的保证代替记录。这样的谨慎救得了药，也会把她的隐瞒照得更清楚。","currentHash":"8d6a925d8a2d3f1ec3a030330e297ed8b3b7ac3a9876c83f88653806b0e9bf1b","sourceCurrent":true,"quoteLocated":true,"quoteOffset":1986,"observed":true,"verified":true},{"resourceRef":"chapter:chapter-003.md","hash":"8d6a925d8a2d3f1ec3a030330e297ed8b3b7ac3a9876c83f88653806b0e9bf1b","location":"L57","quote":"21:03，船抵灯塔诊所外的短栈桥。四十分钟航行之外，三分钟停船检查也记在簿上；冷藏药离柜共四十三分钟，仍在时限内。苏砚当面复核双印和离柜时刻，叶澄系牢船缆，陆行舟把绳段交给队长封存。何芷把药箱交给值夜医师点数，铅封完好，药品齐全。她没有打开暗格。岑寂在交接簿上写下“账页未见”，然后将公文收回。","currentHash":"8d6a925d8a2d3f1ec3a030330e297ed8b3b7ac3a9876c83f88653806b0e9bf1b","sourceCurrent":true,"quoteLocated":true,"quoteOffset":4305,"observed":true,"verified":true},{"resourceRef":"world:lore","hash":"1d840b6aad84b6728ae68fa26509f29591a266edf805e35d7ead815cc8bd031c","location":"L4-L6","quote":"旧渡口到灯塔水路四十分钟，步行绕北堤九十分钟；钟楼到渡口步行十五分钟。不存在瞬移、飞行、瞬间传信。\n封桥时间为21:00，封桥只关闭东桥，不关闭水路；渡船仍须执照和通行证。\n低潮始于20:30，碎石滩不可拖曳重船；正规航道可航行但不得缩短四十分钟。","currentHash":"1d840b6aad84b6728ae68fa26509f29591a266edf805e35d7ead815cc8bd031c","sourceCurrent":true,"quoteLocated":true,"quoteOffset":233,"observed":true,"verified":true}],"evidenceComplete":true,"verified":true}]}
{"schemaVersion":1,"eventId":"bbcc83e4-1714-4eac-8d34-65cebc94c853","timestamp":"2026-10-18T16:51:27.498Z","type":"review_recorded","taskId":"msg-ace5d776-b3bb-46a1-811a-8c78cb34609c","attemptId":"attempt-600c0ca7-8819-4397-a85e-b621e91d3d18","runId":"run-d5dffc32-2b33-42c1-9ce4-24a9ba59a766","reportSha256":"d028dbacc6017182607e2dd353d77928f78f217cf7e5092ccd66095b5b744bfb","parsed":true,"coverageClaimed":["chapter:chapter-003.md","character-memory:character-memory:cen","character-memory:character-memory:he","character-memory:character-memory:lin","character-memory:character-memory:lu","character-memory:character-memory:su","character-memory:character-memory:ye","character:cen","character:he","character:lin","character:lu","character:su","character:ye","world:lore"],"coverageObserved":["chapter:chapter-003.md","character:cen","character:he","character:su","character:lin","character:ye","character:lu","character-memory:he","character-memory:lin","character-memory:cen","character-memory:su","character-memory:lu","world:lore","character-memory:ye","chapter:chapter-002.md"],"coverageVerified":false,"evidenceVerified":true,"issues":[{"issueId":"information-boundary:chapter-003.md:lin_seven_minutes","category":"信息边界","severity":"hard","requestedSeverity":"hard","status":"closed","contradiction":"先前版本曾让林岚当众说出“慢七分钟”，与第二章她没有告诉任何人的记载冲突。当前第三章已修正为只说钟楼报时不准，没有公开误差；在场人物没有因此得知七分钟。","evidence":[{"resourceRef":"chapter:chapter-003.md","hash":"8d6a925d8a2d3f1ec3a030330e297ed8b3b7ac3a9876c83f88653806b0e9bf1b","location":"L31","quote":"林岚收起潮表，只说：“钟楼那声报时不准。”她没有解释缘由，也没有再说下去。没人追问。何芷看见她把怀表往袖口里压深了一点，记住这个沉默，却没有得到答案。","currentHash":"8d6a925d8a2d3f1ec3a030330e297ed8b3b7ac3a9876c83f88653806b0e9bf1b","sourceCurrent":true,"quoteLocated":true,"quoteOffset":2330,"observed":true,"verified":true},{"resourceRef":"chapter:chapter-002.md","hash":"b4929a782ef416eba356589876f55be54d3c1acbdc7c9ee31f6f8c0867c58c70","location":"L59","quote":"20:10。林岚把潮表收回，指腹按着邊角，不让雨水洇开墨线。她没有告诉任何人潮钟慢了七分钟。此刻能确定的只是潮水正在落，航道尚可走；过了二十点半，拖船和抢近路都更危险。","currentHash":"b4929a782ef416eba356589876f55be54d3c1acbdc7c9ee31f6f8c0867c58c70","sourceCurrent":true,"quoteLocated":true,"quoteOffset":3834,"observed":true,"verified":true},{"resourceRef":"character:lin","hash":"1323037282f1622b210209de7f477966cbdf1d671912e44b011c38c62848bd18","location":"L8-L10","quote":"\"欲望\": \"查出潮钟误差，保护弟弟\",\n    \"已知信息\": \"只知道潮钟慢了七分钟；不知道药箱暗格和密道口令\",\n    \"隐瞒事实\": \"保留一页抄本，未告诉任何人\"","currentHash":"1323037282f1622b210209de7f477966cbdf1d671912e44b011c38c62848bd18","sourceCurrent":true,"quoteLocated":true,"quoteOffset":170,"observed":true,"verified":true}],"evidenceComplete":true,"verified":true},{"issueId":"timeline:chapter-003.md:stop_and_arrival","category":"时间连续性","severity":"hard","requestedSeverity":"hard","status":"closed","contradiction":"先前版本的抵达时间未计入明确停船时长。当前正文写明停船三分钟、21:03抵达；20:20至21:03共43分钟，满足世界设定至少40分钟的正规水路航程。冷藏药离柜43分钟，低于60分钟上限。","evidence":[{"resourceRef":"chapter:chapter-003.md","hash":"8d6a925d8a2d3f1ec3a030330e297ed8b3b7ac3a9876c83f88653806b0e9bf1b","location":"L3","quote":"20:20，船离开旧渡口时，何芷仍把手扣在药箱提环上。她没有回头看冰柜。离柜计时从她说“走”时开始，苏砚在药单副页写下时刻，笔尖停得比她预想的久。","currentHash":"8d6a925d8a2d3f1ec3a030330e297ed8b3b7ac3a9876c83f88653806b0e9bf1b","sourceCurrent":true,"quoteLocated":true,"quoteOffset":29,"observed":true,"verified":true},{"resourceRef":"chapter:chapter-003.md","hash":"8d6a925d8a2d3f1ec3a030330e297ed8b3b7ac3a9876c83f88653806b0e9bf1b","location":"L29","quote":"这一停三分钟。苏砚把停船、检查和重启的时刻逐项记下，三分钟没有从航程里消失。何芷看着墨迹，药物离柜的时间一分不少地往前走。她忽然明白，苏砚并非不信她；他是不肯让任何人的保证代替记录。这样的谨慎救得了药，也会把她的隐瞒照得更清楚。","currentHash":"8d6a925d8a2d3f1ec3a030330e297ed8b3b7ac3a9876c83f88653806b0e9bf1b","sourceCurrent":true,"quoteLocated":true,"quoteOffset":1986,"observed":true,"verified":true},{"resourceRef":"chapter:chapter-003.md","hash":"8d6a925d8a2d3f1ec3a030330e297ed8b3b7ac3a9876c83f88653806b0e9bf1b","location":"L57","quote":"21:03，船抵灯塔诊所外的短栈桥。四十分钟航行之外，三分钟停船检查也记在簿上；冷藏药离柜共四十三分钟，仍在时限内。苏砚当面复核双印和离柜时刻，叶澄系牢船缆，陆行舟把绳段交给队长封存。何芷把药箱交给值夜医师点数，铅封完好，药品齐全。她没有打开暗格。岑寂在交接簿上写下“账页未见”，然后将公文收回。","currentHash":"8d6a925d8a2d3f1ec3a030330e297ed8b3b7ac3a9876c83f88653806b0e9bf1b","sourceCurrent":true,"quoteLocated":true,"quoteOffset":4305,"observed":true,"verified":true},{"resourceRef":"world:lore","hash":"1d840b6aad84b6728ae68fa26509f29591a266edf805e35d7ead815cc8bd031c","location":"L4-L6","quote":"旧渡口到灯塔水路四十分钟，步行绕北堤九十分钟；钟楼到渡口步行十五分钟。不存在瞬移、飞行、瞬间传信。\n封桥时间为21:00，封桥只关闭东桥，不关闭水路；渡船仍须执照和通行证。\n低潮始于20:30，碎石滩不可拖曳重船；正规航道可航行但不得缩短四十分钟。","currentHash":"1d840b6aad84b6728ae68fa26509f29591a266edf805e35d7ead815cc8bd031c","sourceCurrent":true,"quoteLocated":true,"quoteOffset":233,"observed":true,"verified":true},{"resourceRef":"world:lore","hash":"1d840b6aad84b6728ae68fa26509f29591a266edf805e35d7ead815cc8bd031c","location":"L13","quote":"药箱铅封完整，开启外箱会破坏铅封；暗格可在保持铅封时滑出，但外人看不出位置。冷藏药离开冰柜后只能保存六十分钟。","currentHash":"1d840b6aad84b6728ae68fa26509f29591a266edf805e35d7ead815cc8bd031c","sourceCurrent":true,"quoteLocated":true,"quoteOffset":1083,"observed":true,"verified":true}],"evidenceComplete":true,"verified":true}]}
