{"schemaVersion":1,"eventId":"ef40b078-2074-4767-92a2-e08d7b3a1dfd","timestamp":"2026-10-18T16:55:00.301Z","type":"review_recorded","taskId":"msg-ace5d776-b3bb-46a1-811a-8c78cb34609c","attemptId":"attempt-ed17dde7-7287-41cb-ba4d-20eea6b18a24","runId":"run-2a5d4547-4f03-4096-a705-7fb4a4cb8c44","reportSha256":"21cc85f182e9ef084af18b7113d147feff626182bfbb21e2b4187c129abb6611","parsed":true,"coverageClaimed":["chapter:chapter-003.md","character-memory:cen","character-memory:he","character-memory:lin","character-memory:lu","character-memory:su","character-memory:ye","character:cen","character:he","character:lin","character:lu","character:su","character:ye","world:lore"],"coverageObserved":["chapter:chapter-003.md","character:cen","character:he","character:lin","character:ye","character:su","character:lu","character-memory:he","character-memory:cen","character-memory:lin","character-memory:lu","character-memory:su","world:lore","character-memory:ye"],"coverageVerified":true,"evidenceVerified":false,"issues":[{"issueId":"information-boundary:chapter-003.md:lin_seven_minutes","category":"信息边界","severity":"suspicion","requestedSeverity":"hard","status":"closed","contradiction":"先前版本让林岚当众说出潮钟慢七分钟，与第二章她未告诉任何人的记载冲突。当前第三章已修正为只说钟楼报时不准；其他人物没有因此获知七分钟。六份记忆中也未将这一数字写入其他角色的本章新知。","evidence":[{"resourceRef":"chapter:chapter-003.md","hash":"8d6a925d8a2d3f1ec3a030330e297ed8b3b7ac3a9876c83f88653806b0e9bf1b","location":"L31","quote":"林岚收起潮表，只说：“钟楼那声报时不准。”她没有解释缘由，也没有再说下去。没人追问。何芷看见她把怀表往袖口里压深了一点，记住这个沉默，却没有得到答案。","currentHash":"8d6a925d8a2d3f1ec3a030330e297ed8b3b7ac3a9876c83f88653806b0e9bf1b","sourceCurrent":true,"quoteLocated":true,"quoteOffset":2330,"observed":true,"verified":true},{"resourceRef":"chapter:chapter-002.md","hash":"b4929a782ef416eba356589876f55be54d3c1acbdc7c9ee31f6f8c0867c58c70","location":"L59","quote":"20:10。林岚把潮表收回，指腹按着邊角，不让雨水洇开墨线。她没有告诉任何人潮钟慢了七分钟。此刻能确定的只是潮水正在落，航道尚可走；过了二十点半，拖船和抢近路都更危险。","currentHash":"b4929a782ef416eba356589876f55be54d3c1acbdc7c9ee31f6f8c0867c58c70","sourceCurrent":true,"quoteLocated":true,"quoteOffset":3834,"observed":false,"verified":false},{"resourceRef":"character:lin","hash":"1323037282f1622b210209de7f477966cbdf1d671912e44b011c38c62848bd18","location":"L8-L10","quote":"\"欲望\": \"查出潮钟误差，保护弟弟\",\n    \"已知信息\": \"只知道潮钟慢了七分钟；不知道药箱暗格和密道口令\",\n    \"隐瞒事实\": \"保留一页抄本，未告诉任何人\"","currentHash":"1323037282f1622b210209de7f477966cbdf1d671912e44b011c38c62848bd18","sourceCurrent":true,"quoteLocated":true,"quoteOffset":170,"observed":true,"verified":true},{"resourceRef":"character-memory:lin","hash":"da62852799bbc0732d5d3a72dabc2bd6fde11bfcccbc07fc4a3da8f02fe93cfe","location":"L12-L14","quote":"\"id\": \"lin-ch3\",\n      \"summary\": \"看見正航道漂木导致船停三分钟，听见叶澄说明正航道也有漂木；看见陆行舟辨认湿绳并限定自己只能辨认绞法，听见岑寂与何芷谈账页交接；她只说钟楼报时不准，未对众人说明误差\",\n      \"sourceChapterRef\": \"chapter:chapter-003.md\"","currentHash":"da62852799bbc0732d5d3a72dabc2bd6fde11bfcccbc07fc4a3da8f02fe93cfe","sourceCurrent":true,"quoteLocated":true,"quoteOffset":312,"observed":true,"verified":true}],"evidenceComplete":true,"verified":false},{"issueId":"timeline:chapter-003.md:stop_and_arrival","category":"时间连续性","severity":"hard","requestedSeverity":"hard","status":"closed","contradiction":"当前正文明确停船三分钟，并将抵达时间修正为21:03。20:20至21:03共43分钟，符合至少40分钟的正规水路航程。药物离柜43分钟，未超过60分钟冷藏时限。","evidence":[{"resourceRef":"chapter:chapter-003.md","hash":"8d6a925d8a2d3f1ec3a030330e297ed8b3b7ac3a9876c83f88653806b0e9bf1b","location":"L3","quote":"20:20，船离开旧渡口时，何芷仍把手扣在药箱提环上。她没有回头看冰柜。离柜计时从她说“走”时开始，苏砚在药单副页写下时刻，笔尖停得比她预想的久。","currentHash":"8d6a925d8a2d3f1ec3a030330e297ed8b3b7ac3a9876c83f88653806b0e9bf1b","sourceCurrent":true,"quoteLocated":true,"quoteOffset":29,"observed":true,"verified":true},{"resourceRef":"chapter:chapter-003.md","hash":"8d6a925d8a2d3f1ec3a030330e297ed8b3b7ac3a9876c83f88653806b0e9bf1b","location":"L29","quote":"这一停三分钟。苏砚把停船、检查和重启的时刻逐项记下，三分钟没有从航程里消失。何芷看着墨迹，药物离柜的时间一分不少地往前走。她忽然明白，苏砚并非不信她；他是不肯让任何人的保证代替记录。这样的谨慎救得了药，也会把她的隐瞒照得更清楚。","currentHash":"8d6a925d8a2d3f1ec3a030330e297ed8b3b7ac3a9876c83f88653806b0e9bf1b","sourceCurrent":true,"quoteLocated":true,"quoteOffset":1986,"observed":true,"verified":true},{"resourceRef":"chapter:chapter-003.md","hash":"8d6a925d8a2d3f1ec3a030330e297ed8b3b7ac3a9876c83f88653806b0e9bf1b","location":"L57","quote":"21:03，船抵灯塔诊所外的短栈桥。四十分钟航行之外，三分钟停船检查也记在簿上；冷藏药离柜共四十三分钟，仍在时限内。苏砚当面复核双印和离柜时刻，叶澄系牢船缆，陆行舟把绳段交给队长封存。何芷把药箱交给值夜医师点数，铅封完好，药品齐全。她没有打开暗格。岑寂在交接簿上写下“账页未见”，然后将公文收回。","currentHash":"8d6a925d8a2d3f1ec3a030330e297ed8b3b7ac3a9876c83f88653806b0e9bf1b","sourceCurrent":true,"quoteLocated":true,"quoteOffset":4305,"observed":true,"verified":true},{"resourceRef":"world:lore","hash":"1d840b6aad84b6728ae68fa26509f29591a266edf805e35d7ead815cc8bd031c","location":"L4-L6","quote":"旧渡口到灯塔水路四十分钟，步行绕北堤九十分钟；钟楼到渡口步行十五分钟。不存在瞬移、飞行、瞬间传信。\n封桥时间为21:00，封桥只关闭东桥，不关闭水路；渡船仍须执照和通行证。\n低潮始于20:30，碎石滩不可拖曳重船；正规航道可航行但不得缩短四十分钟。","currentHash":"1d840b6aad84b6728ae68fa26509f29591a266edf805e35d7ead815cc8bd031c","sourceCurrent":true,"quoteLocated":true,"quoteOffset":233,"observed":true,"verified":true},{"resourceRef":"world:lore","hash":"1d840b6aad84b6728ae68fa26509f29591a266edf805e35d7ead815cc8bd031c","location":"L13","quote":"药箱铅封完整，开启外箱会破坏铅封；暗格可在保持铅封时滑出，但外人看不出位置。冷藏药离开冰柜后只能保存六十分钟。","currentHash":"1d840b6aad84b6728ae68fa26509f29591a266edf805e35d7ead815cc8bd031c","sourceCurrent":true,"quoteLocated":true,"quoteOffset":1083,"observed":true,"verified":true}],"evidenceComplete":true,"verified":true}]}
